A malformed language tag leaves the whole block literal

```
[a]{:en_US} [b]{:-en} [c]{:en-} [d]{:français}
.
<p>[a]{:en_US} [b]{:-en} [c]{:en-} [d]{:français}</p>
```

```
[a]{:abcdefgh} [b]{:abcdefghi}
.
<p><span lang="abcdefgh">a</span> [b]{:abcdefghi}</p>
```

```
[x]{:tada:}
.
<p>[x]{:tada:}</p>
```

```
[x]{xml:lang=en}
.
<p>[x]{xml:lang=en}</p>
```
